The '''9f™ Network''' is a [[Quest]] given by {{NPCSprite|Tia the Fairy}} which spans the [[SkyBlock]] world, and requires the [[player]] to repair '''9f™ Network Relays''' by selecting correct sounds.

== Quest ==
After adding {{NPCSprite|Tia the Fairy}} on the player's {{Item|Abiphone Basic|text=Abiphone}}, a '''9f™ Operator Chip''' will be added into it. If {{NPCSprite|Tia the Fairy;Tia's}} [[Abiphones#Contacts|contact]] is removed, the '''Chip''' - alongside any rewards granted by it - will be removed as well and only granted again once the contact is readded.

The [[player]] can then call {{NPCSprite|Tia the Fairy;Tia}} for a hint on where a '''9f™ Network Relay''' might be found. In order to be able to see the '''Relays''', the {{Item|Fairy Armor}} needs to be worn. There are a total of 9 '''Network Relays''', each of which can be repaired by playing a [[#Gameplay|minigame]]. The more of them has the [[player]] repaired, the greater the reward granted by the '''9f™ Operator Chip''', as shown in a table below:

